  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Cut pork into 1-inch cubes.",
    "3. In a large bowl, mix together paprika, garlic, salt, and pepper.",
    "4. Add pork cubes to the bowl and toss to coat with spice mixture.",
    "5. Thread pork cubes onto skewers.",
    "6. Brush skewers with olive oil.",
